    <title>Advances in Large Language Model Reasoning</title>
    <summary>
      We present a comprehensive study of reasoning capabilities in large language
      models. Our approach demonstrates significant improvements in chain-of-thought
      reasoning across multiple benchmarks.
    </summary>
