    <title>Neural Architecture Search for Efficient Transformers</title>
    <summary>
      This paper introduces a novel neural architecture search method specifically
      designed for discovering efficient transformer architectures. We achieve
      state-of-the-art results while reducing computational costs.
    </summary>
